  "uuid": "cc367874-084e-4978-9b63-78c07789331c",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "dcfc9220-8eb8-f36d-3636-83ae92e9fca7",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "652e1bb5-4da9-c1b1-87d6-1aebb393403e",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Since its inception, the EyeSurg Tournament has been organized four times, drawing participants from a range of institutions including the Aga Khan University, the Harvard Medical School's Department of Ophthalmology, the New England Eye Center at Tufts University, the UMass Memorial Eye Center, Isra University, Shifa College of Medicine in Islamabad, and Sindh Institute of Ophthalmology and Visual Sciences in Hyderabad. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Most recently, the EyeSurg Tournaments were held for the Harvard Medical School's Department of Ophthalmology and the UMass Memorial Eye Center, USA. These tournaments have set a benchmark for future events, with other institutes already scheduled to conduct similar tournaments in the future. Plans are also underway to host an International EyeSurg Tournament, where residents and institutes from all over the world will compete in this unique activity. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "This tournament is an excellent example of how technology can be used to enhance healthcare education and training. The success of these tournaments demonstrates the potential for simulation-based training to revolutionize healthcare education and training in the future.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
