    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The EyeSurg Tournament has become a remarkable example of partnership between the Department of Ophthalmology and Visual Sciences and the Centre for Innovation in Medical Education. The tournament engages residents and students in a competitive and safe learning environment where they can practice eye surgery and improve their surgical skills on simulators. The inaugural tournament was held in August 2021, organized by a team led by Dr. M. Bilal Malik, Resident year IV of Ophthalmology at AKU.",
